完整示例项目。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:06:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0ee8a17db2d297758aa0305735b027e679b740b7</guid><source url="https://dev.to/oubastudio/building-a-zero-dependency-branching-interactive-fiction-engine-in-90-lines-of-esm-1m6c">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>为英国学校做游戏化学习模块：开工前的预生产清单</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/building-a-game-based-learning-module-for-uk-schools-a-pre-production-checklist-1p7e</link><description>给英国学校做游戏化学习模块，成败往往在写代码之前就定了，这份预生产清单帮小团队先把课时、设备、课程标准与数据合规这些硬约束理清楚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:50:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6b0761ff3325ea4ea3b9d79b55014b1c5c2fd222</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/building-a-game-based-learning-module-for-uk-schools-a-pre-production-checklist-1p7e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了个本地高斯泼溅转游戏网格工具，改成一次性买断而不做订阅</title><link>https://dev.to/stephen487/i-built-a-local-gaussian-splat-to-game-mesh-converter-and-sold-it-as-a-one-off-instead-of-a-29l8</link><description>作者把高斯泼溅点云转成带贴图、碰撞体和两档 LOD 的游戏可用网格，做成本地运行的一次性买断小工具，并分享了这条变现路线的取舍。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:08:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f85a2fd1d8f7514362a163aa04859895aa2f605d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/stephen487/i-built-a-local-gaussian-splat-to-game-mesh-converter-and-sold-it-as-a-one-off-instead-of-a-29l8">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用文字提示设计音效的实用工作流</title><link>https://dev.to/sfxv3_audio/a-practical-workflow-for-designing-sound-effects-from-text-prompts-5d7m</link><description>从一句清晰的文字描述出发，先生成、再聆听、再细化提示词，这篇文章给出了一套用文本提示做游戏音效的实操流程，适合想快速出音效原型的独立开发者。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:54:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e10ab21f363b017103eb65064cc3a6571b1e3e1d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/sfxv3_audio/a-practical-workflow-for-designing-sound-effects-from-text-prompts-5d7m">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>俄罗斯要搞游戏版号？考虑强制游戏许可，并允许安全局获取玩家数据</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607139</link><description>俄罗斯正考虑对游戏实行强制发行许可，并要求配合监控，让安全部门能够获取玩家数据，值得关注出海合规风向。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:25:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ddf04b4d07b05bb91877c5ae0f53b125ad4fba5e</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607139">GameLook</source></item><item><title>开发者心寒：游戏大厂随心所欲用AI，独游用AI就得被喷垃圾？</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607090</link><description>大厂用 AI 是降本增效，独立游戏用 AI 却被贴上“垃圾”标签，这篇文章聊的是这种双标背后的舆论落差。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:50:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">380549f15400c716f5157b7606fef32cd885afcb</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607090">GameLook</source></item><item><title>“猫咪游戏专业户”来中国踢馆：上线抖音微信小游戏，月收入破5000万！</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607062</link><description>一家专做猫咪游戏的海外团队杀进中国小游戏市场，靠抖音和微信小游戏月入破五千万，复盘了它的打法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:47:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cd56bdf2f63ec1b16d8d198cfd83a6f083a17777</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607062">GameLook</source></item><item><title>GTA6首日收入37.9亿美元：过半主机玩家首日入手游戏，下载带宽占全美24%</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607063</link><description>《GTA 6》首日狂揽 37.9 亿美元，超半数主机玩家当天入手，下载流量一度占到全美带宽的四分之一。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:43:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6162d666a978b697bc8fcb1b6804c0c1e26ef706</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607063">GameLook</source></item><item><title>V.E.T.O.R：HTML5 Canvas 动作 RPG 的架构与 Limbo 蜘蛛 Boss 战（Demo V6.2 已出）</title><link>https://dev.to/jonie_rangel_051969a0f3fe/vetor-a-ruptura-architecture-of-an-html5-canvas-action-rpg-limbo-spider-boss-fight-demo-5gn8</link><description>独立科幻动作 RPG 不用现成商业引擎，自研双层 Canvas 与视频同步渲染管线，文章拆解引擎架构与 Limbo 蜘蛛 Boss 战的设计，Demo V6.2 已可下载试玩。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:09:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">62a114278b1ac971fd71d5dcd69f578ad2def092</guid><source url="https://dev.to/jonie_rangel_051969a0f3fe/vetor-a-ruptura-architecture-of-an-html5-canvas-action-rpg-limbo-spider-boss-fight-demo-5gn8">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>一张照片做出引擎可用的贴图：Unreal、Unity 与 Godot 通用检查清单</title><link>https://dev.to/jiawenzhang/engine-ready-texture-maps-from-one-photo-a-checklist-for-unreal-unity-and-godot-2ekc</link><description>一张照片就能起步，但引擎要的是一整套法线、高度、粗糙度与 AO 贴图，这篇清单讲了如何不踩坑地做出这四张图。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:12:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96d33033c745fdcbd8c5dce3f922a1f49895a24f</guid><source url="https://dev.to/jiawenzhang/engine-ready-texture-maps-from-one-photo-a-checklist-for-unreal-unity-and-godot-2ekc">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unity 中端手机性能优化八点复盘</title><link>https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298719-a-unity-performance-pass-for-mid-range-phones-an-eight-point-review</link><description>针对中端机型的 Unity 性能优化清单，八个检查点帮手游在老设备上稳住帧率与留存。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:48:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b3bc07e849e66b87cb64e7e5e6808452056de025</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298719-a-unity-performance-pass-for-mid-range-phones-an-eight-point-review">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>为什么日文只在打包后的 UE5 版本里变成方块字</title><link>https://dev.to/sasakidevtools/why-japanese-text-turns-into-tofu-boxes-only-in-packaged-unreal-engine-5-builds-91c</link><description>编辑器里正常显示的日文，打包后却变成方块字，一位日本独立开发者追踪了这个字体问题的根源。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:20:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c236721185f7b742e5dcfb9745210787d6adbb8</guid><source url="https://dev.to/sasakidevtools/why-japanese-text-turns-into-tofu-boxes-only-in-packaged-unreal-engine-5-builds-91c">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>小米做的概念超跑，为什么要在游戏里寻求真实感</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671</link><description>对话小米汽车设计负责人，聊小米概念超跑如何借《跑车浪漫旅 7》的 Vision GT 企划在游戏中追求真实感，跨界合作的思路对做载具与品牌联动的开发者有参考价值。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bdfded30f687c943adc4609f63854c77163f2dbd</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671">游研社</source></item></channel></rss>
